---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Futures Literacies in Praxis · Quest Labs"
  description="Futures Literacies in Praxis is a 12-week futures literacy program designed specifically for educators. Develop the tools to bring healing-centered, play-based foresight into your classroom and school community."
>

<div class="edu-page">

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO: keep as-is
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Quest Labs · Educators Cohort · Fall 2026</div>
      <h1 class="hero-flip">FLIP</h1>
      <p class="hero-program-name">Futures Literacies <em>in Praxis</em> <span style="font-size:0.75em;opacity:0.6;font-style:italic;">(theory in action)</span></p>
      <p class="hero-program-name" style="margin-top:-0.5rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;font-size:clamp(0.95rem,2vw,1.15rem);letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:none;font-style:italic;">Futures literacy is the art of reading the room, reading the moment, and writing a future you want to wake up to.</p>
      <p class="hero-sub">This is for you. What you learn about yourself will change what you bring to your classroom, but this process is for you. To meet your future self, as you navigate a world that keeps changing underneath your feet.</p>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-num">20</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Per cohort</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-num">12</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Weeks of practice</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-num">7</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Futures literacies</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-num">∞</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Possible futures</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-credential">Built from 545 contributions by 170 educators across two healing-centered gatherings. Debuted at the 2025 International Healing-Centered Education Conference.</p>
      <div class="cta-group">
        <div class="cta-with-note">
          <a href="#game-nights" class="btn btn-primary">Join a Game Night</a>
          <span class="cta-micro-note">free · no commitment</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-ghost">Fall 2026 Cohort</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-onepager" style="margin-top:0.75rem;">
        <a href="/flip-one-pager" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hero-onepager__link">View the FLIP one-pager →</a>
        <span class="hero-onepager__note">Full program overview, designed for print or screen.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       BEAT 1: THE MIRROR
       "You've been here before. This is different."
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-tag">The situation</div>
      <h2>The script we're all<br>still <em>reading from</em></h2>

      <p>The world we're being asked to prepare students for keeps morphing faster than our nervous systems, and the systems built to support us, were ever designed to handle.</p>
      <p>Something is different here. This is what we reach for.</p>

      <div class="problem-cols">
        <div class="prob-col">
          <h4>The water we're swimming in</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Volun-told to attend another training</li>
            <li>Check the box, move on</li>
            <li>One and done, see you next year</li>
            <li>It's always been done like this</li>
            <li>More to carry, less time to breathe</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-col bright">
          <h4>What we're reaching toward</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>You chose to be here</li>
            <li>Praxis (theory in action) as the primary mode</li>
            <li>A practice that deepens over time</li>
            <li>Futures as something you build a relationship with</li>
            <li>More capacity, more community, more possible</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pull quote: standalone visual moment -->
  <section class="pull-quote-section">
    <div class="container">
      <blockquote class="pull-quote-solo">
        "You are not broken. Neither is the system. It is working exactly as it was designed. You, however, are paying attention. That's why you're here."
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       BEAT 2: WHO THIS IS FOR
       Fast self-sorting. One and they know.
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-tag">Who belongs here</div>
      <h2>The whole adult<br><em>ecosystem</em></h2>
      <p class="role-list">Classroom teachers. Instructional coaches. Curriculum designers. Principals. Assistant principals. Department heads. District leads. Learning experience designers.</p>
      <p>Each cohort is capped at 20 to keep it real. Intimate. Honest. Diverse.</p>

      <div class="who-list who-list--archetypes">
        <div class="who-row">
          <div class="who-label">The Winded Visionary</div>
          <div class="who-text">You believe in futures thinking. You believe in your students. You're running on fumes from trying to do transformative work inside a system that wasn't built for it. This is a place to put down the performance and pick up a practice.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-row">
          <div class="who-label">The Curious Skeptic</div>
          <div class="who-text">You've seen "transformative PD" before. Your caution is earned. Come see what happens when the room is actually built differently. If it doesn't land for you, your feedback is the gift.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-row">
          <div class="who-label">The Already-Doing-It</div>
          <div class="who-text">You're already running futures-oriented practice in your classroom or school. You need community, language, and a place to go deeper. There are more of us than you think.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-row">
          <div class="who-label">The Systems Thinker</div>
          <div class="who-text">Curriculum director. Instructional coach. School leader navigating more than anyone should have to right now. You sit at the intersection of what is and what could be. This practice is built for people who think in ecosystems.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHERE YOU'RE AT — Micro / Focus / Full
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-tag">Where you're at</div>
      <h2>Wherever you are,<br><em>there's a way in.</em></h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">Three ways to walk with us. Choose the one that fits your season.</p>
      <div class="three-doors">

        <div class="door-card">
          <div class="door-emoji">🪶</div>
          <h3 class="door-title">Micro</h3>
          <p>Follow along online with the prompt. Free, async, no signup. Come back when the season is right.</p>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/questlabsworld" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost door-cta">Follow along →</a>
          <p class="cta-micro">free · Instagram + LinkedIn</p>
        </div>

        <div class="door-card">
          <div class="door-emoji">🧭</div>
          <h3 class="door-title">Focus</h3>
          <p>Come where you can fit in. Move along with the analog tools. Join us when your calendar lets you. The Flexible Path, at your pace.</p>
          <a href="#investment" class="btn btn-ghost door-cta">See the Flexible Path →</a>
          <p class="cta-micro">sliding scale · come as you can</p>
        </div>

        <div class="door-card door-card--featured">
          <div class="door-emoji">🌀</div>
          <h3 class="door-title">Full</h3>
          <p>Join the cohort. Get a dyad practice partner. Experience the whole 12-week learning journey. The Full Arc.</p>
          <a href="#signup" class="btn btn-primary door-cta">Raise my hand →</a>
          <p class="cta-micro">sliding scale · limited capacity</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:2.5rem; text-align:center; padding-top:1.5rem; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim); font-size:0.95rem;">
        🏫 &nbsp; Bringing this to your whole school or team? <a href="/contact" class="inline-link">Let's talk →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Fall Cohort Investment / Pricing Tiers -->
  <section id="investment">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-tag">The Fall Cohort investment</div>
      <h2>Two paths.<br><em>One sliding scale.</em></h2>
      <p>For the Fall Cohort. Focus (Flexible Path) and Full (Full Arc) are both on a sliding scale. Choose the level of commitment that's true for you, then the price point that's honest. The person at the top of the scale funds the person at the bottom. That's the model.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem; margin-top:-0.5rem;">Micro is free. <a href="https://www.instagram.com/questlabsworld" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">Follow along on Instagram</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/quest-labs-world" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">LinkedIn</a>.</p>

      <div class="tier-grid">

        <div class="tier-card tier-card--mid">
          <div class="tier-eyebrow">Focus · Traveler</div>
          <div class="tier-emoji">🧭</div>
          <h3 class="tier-name">The Flexible Path</h3>
          <p class="tier-desc">Make the sessions you can make. Flipped classroom model: pre-recorded session content, a dyad partner you meet with independently, integration sessions mid-week, occasional live attendance when you can show up. You're in the practice, at your pace.</p>
          <p class="tier-for"><strong>Right for you if:</strong> Your schedule is full and your heart is in it. You need the container without the rigidity.</p>
          <div class="tier-scale">
            <div class="tier-scale-row tier-scale-support">
              <div class="tier-scale-price">$247</div>
              <div class="tier-scale-label">Need support</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-scale-row tier-scale-standard">
              <div class="tier-scale-price">$397</div>
              <div class="tier-scale-label">Standard investment</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-scale-row tier-scale-forward">
              <div class="tier-scale-price">$497</div>
              <div class="tier-scale-label">Pay it forward</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-note">PD budget eligible · Sponsored seats available</div>
        </div>

        <div class="tier-card tier-card--full">
          <div class="tier-eyebrow">Full · World Weaver</div>
          <div class="tier-emoji">🌀</div>
          <h3 class="tier-name">The Full Arc</h3>
          <p class="tier-desc">You're here. Every session, morning pages, artist's date, your dyad partner every week, the Wednesday three-word drop. Two touchpoints throughout the week: live session plus integration. The full 12-week arc, beginning to declaration.</p>
          <p class="tier-for"><strong>Right for you if:</strong> You came to transform. In practice and in the room.</p>
          <ul class="tier-outcomes">
            <li>A futures-literate teaching practice you can name and defend</li>
            <li>A professional portfolio with before-and-after evidence</li>
            <li>A cohort of colleagues who know what you're building</li>
            <li>A rubric your admin can read</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tier-scale">
            <div class="tier-scale-row tier-scale-support">
              <div class="tier-scale-price">$497</div>
              <div class="tier-scale-label">Need support</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-scale-row tier-scale-standard">
              <div class="tier-scale-price">$797</div>
              <div class="tier-scale-label">Standard investment</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tier-scale-row tier-scale-forward">
              <div class="tier-scale-price">$997</div>
              <div class="tier-scale-label">Pay it forward, funds a sponsored seat</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-note">PD budget eligible · School team rates available · Sponsored seats available</div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="witness-note">
        Curious but not convinced? Follow the journey on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/questlabsworld" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/quest-labs-world" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>. Session reflections, provocation drops, and the declaration that builds one word at a time across all 12 weeks. Free, no registration. Come back when the season is right.
      </div>

      <div class="sponsored-note">
        <strong>Sponsored seats.</strong> Every cohort holds seats for educators whose schools or districts cannot cover the cost. Access is not conditional on ability to pay. To inquire: <a href="mailto:questlabs.world@proton.me">questlabs.world@proton.me</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       BEAT 3: WHAT ACTUALLY HAPPENS
       Proof of structure + proof of care.
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="what-happens">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-tag">The practice</div>
      <h2>What actually<br><em>happens</em></h2>
      <p>Futures Literacies in Praxis runs on a 12-week arc, adapted specifically for educators and educational leaders. Each session is a living laboratory. A place where the moment you are trying to meet becomes the curriculum. Capped at 20 people so the room stays real. From Week 1, you are paired with a dyad partner: a companion who walks the whole 12-week journey with you.</p>

      <div class="pull">
        <p>Go fast, go alone. Go further, go together.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="inline-blurb">Another set of companions: five archetypes from the Black Menagerie (five characters used as lenses to navigate the future) serve as your navigational lens throughout. You'll meet them in the room. <a href="/black-menagerie" class="inline-link">Meet the Black Menagerie →</a></p>

      <p class="inline-blurb">Built on the Futures Alphabet framework that emerged from 545 contributions by 170 educators. A living methodology. <a href="/foundations" class="inline-link">Explore the foundations ↗</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       GAME NIGHTS
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="game-nights">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-tag">Game Nights</div>
      <h2>The game nights,<br><em>with the bingo.</em></h2>
      <p>Pop in for one session. Glowup advisory story creation for your future memory. Come play, come think, come name what you're seeing. Pattern-recognition as practice.</p>

      <div class="who-list" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
        <div class="who-row">
          <div class="who-label">Format</div>
          <div class="who-text">Via Zoom. Come to one, come to all.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="who-row">
          <div class="who-label">Cost</div>
          <div class="who-text">Donation based. Pay what you can, pay what feels right, pay nothing if now is not the time.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="font-style:italic; opacity:0.85;"><strong>Cadence, timing, and the game itself are still being finalized.</strong> See what's next and RSVP on Luma.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <a href="https://lu.ma/questlabs" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">See the next Game Night on Luma →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
       PAST SESSIONS · archive
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="past-sessions">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-tag">Past sessions</div>
      <h2>The living<br><em>archive.</em></h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">Sessions we've held. Contributions from educators, researchers, and community members across two years of practice.</p>

      <h3 style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:0.75rem; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.7; margin-top:2rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">2026</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0;">
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Summer Sandbox 2026 · May – Sept 2026 · Summer series</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Wounded Healer to World Weaver · May 24, 2026 · Healing Futures</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Cosmos, Shorts &amp; Playgrounds · May 18, 2026 · JFS Futures Community</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Sarkar Sandbox 4.0 · May 17, 2026 · Sandbox</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Sarkar Sandbox: AI in Education · May 1, 2026 · L4E + Quest Labs</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">FLIP Cohort Launch · April 22, 2026 · Quest Labs</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Imagination Infrastructure · March 19, 2026 · JFS Futures Community</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Women's International Day Sandbox · March 8, 2026 · Special Session</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">A New Game of Life · February 25, 2026 · Sandbox</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Learning Lab · February 12, 2026 · Sandbox</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Underground Futures · January 29, 2026 · Futures Lab</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Futures in Praxis · January 8, 2026 · Sandbox</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:0.75rem; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.7; margin-top:2.5rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">2025</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0;">
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Making It Real · December 18, 2025 · Sandbox</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Permission to Play · December 4, 2025 · Sandbox</li>
