        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Systems Thinking Unlocked · November 6, 2025 · Sandbox</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Elders Circle · October 29, 2025 · Sandbox</li>
        <li style="padding:0.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--border-dim); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-dim);">Portal of Possibilities · July 2025 · Healing Centered Futures Summit</li>
